        "TileImage": "$($repository 928fe230-791b-4f73-a617-ec05c35d6902).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets at the Milton-Fitzpatrick branch bank in New York. Below are the list of your targets as well as the preferred methods for taking them down;\r\rEliminate Mateo Perez with injected lethal poison.\rEliminate Ruby Red with Fibre wire. \rEliminate Tim Weimer with an electricution.\rEliminate Lewis Thomas by drowning him. \rEliminate Fabian Mann with a remote explosive. \r\rExcercise caution and keep it clean.\r\rBreak a leg and best of luck!\rReapingZ",
